# Ireland Total Overhaul — Northern Settlement Ledger.
# GUI-only surface contract. The scripted-GUI registration supplies the live model,
# regional state, stage and failure projections without granting settlement effects.
# Live runtime sources: slopx_ireland_northern_unionist_consent,
# slopx_ireland_northern_nationalist_consent, slopx_ireland_northern_labour_cooperation,
# slopx_ireland_northern_british_flexibility, slopx_ireland_northern_security_stability,
# slopx_ireland_northern_integration_capacity and slopx_ireland_northern_integration_stage.
# Model, region and failure are scripted-localisation projections from the route flags,
# integration stage and active Northern review/failure state.
# Registration handoff: window_name = slopx_ireland_northern_settlement_ledger_window
# context_type = decision_category; no parent-window token is used.
# dirty = slopx_ireland_northern_gui_dirty
# click hooks = *_unionist_row, *_nationalist_row, *_labour_row, *_british_row,
# *_security_row, *_integration_row, *_review_button, *_close_button.

